{"nerai":"","spec":"<div id=\"post\">\n    <div class=\"tab\">\n        \n        <h1 class=\"setting\">設定狙い：設定判別</h1>\n       \n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">まずはココを見ろ！</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h5>①</h5>\n                \n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">設定判別項目</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>確定演出</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">ボーナス当選時のシーサーランプ</td>\n                            <td>☆☆☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常時</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">ボーナス(AT)確率</td>\n                            <td>★★☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">にんじんA出現率</td>\n                            <td>☆☆☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>        \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">成立役別のボーナス当選率</td>\n                            <td>☆☆☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>                        \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">ボーナス当選時の振り分け</td>\n                            <td>☆☆☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>                        \n                \n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                \n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>ボーナス中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 73%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>重要度</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">ナビ無し3枚役出現率</td>\n                            <td>☆☆☆☆☆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ざっくり設定判別</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        \n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">ツモった際のやめ時</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>大まかな目安</h3>\n                <h4>やめ推奨時間</h4>\n                <p><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n                <h4>閉店欠損度</h4>\n                <p>☆☆☆☆☆</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>解説</h3>\n                <p>現在調査中です。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" id=\"destination1\">スペック</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>ボーナス(AT)確率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:35%;\">初当り確率<br>(25φ)</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:35%;\">初当り確率<br>(30φ)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定0</td>\n                            <td>－</td>\n                            <td>－</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/230.4</td>\n                            <td>1/236.7</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/225.2</td>\n                            <td>1/233.7</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>1/220.6</td>\n                            <td>1/227.5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/213.2</td>\n                            <td>1/221.5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/208.4</td>\n                            <td>1/221.4</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:35%;\">出玉率<br>(25φ)</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:35%;\">出玉率<br>(30φ)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定0</td>\n                            <td>－</td>\n                            <td>－</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>97.8%</td>\n                            <td>97.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>98.9%</td>\n                            <td>98.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>102.5%</td>\n                            <td>102.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>104.6%</td>\n                            <td>105.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>108.0%</td>\n                            <td>108.4%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <div class=\"caution\">\n                    <p>注意</p>\n                    <p>設定0は以下の挙動が見られます。</p>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li>下パネルが常時消灯</li>\n                        <li>音量が最小</li>\n                        <li>リール停止ボタンが緑色<br>(設定0以外は赤色)</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">基本情報</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>天井・打ち方・詳細情報</h3>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 50%;\">項目</th>\n                            <th>記載</th>\n                        </tr><tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">天井情報</td>\n                            <td>ボーナス間天井<br>天国間天井</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">打ち方</td>\n                            <td>通常時の打ち方<br>ボーナス中の打ち方</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">ハイエナ詳細情報</td>\n                            <td>その他のハイエナ情報</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n    \n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">数値詳細</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination30\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    ボーナス当選時のシーサーランプ</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>ボーナスに当選した際、シーサーランプがどのパターンで点灯するかによって、設定や天国が示唆されることがあります。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width:50%;\">点灯パターン</th>\n                            <th>示唆内容</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>右のみ点滅</td>\n                            <td>設定2以上濃厚<br>+天国濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>左のみ点滅</td>\n                            <td><span style=\"color:#0071C1;\">設定4以上濃厚</span><br>+天国濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>線香花火</td>\n                            <td><span style=\"color:#FE67FF;\">設定6濃厚</span><br>+天国濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n\n            \n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination3\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    にんじんA出現率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>にんじんAの出現率は高設定ほど出現しやすい模様です。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination4\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    成立役別のボーナス当選率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>通常時のボーナス抽選では、内部状態が通常なのかボーナス高確率なのかで当選率が動き、内部状態が通常中の当選率については設定差が設けられています。</p>\n\n                <h4>設定差のあるボーナス当選率</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">にんじんA</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">にんじんB</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">ゴーヤ</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>0.4%</td>\n                            <td>0.4%</td>\n                            <td>0.4%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>0.4%</td>\n                            <td>0.8%</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>0.8%</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1.2%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                            <td>1.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n\n                <h4>設定差のないボーナス当選率</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常中</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">にんじん<br>揃い</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">確定<br>にんじん</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:25%;\">リーチ目役</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">41%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">100%</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">100%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination5\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    ボーナス当選時の振り分け</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>通常時にボーナスへ振り分けられる内容は通常モードと天国モードとで異なり、通常モード滞在中のBIG比率にはわずかながら設定差があります。</p>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <caption>通常モード時のボーナス振り分け<br>(天国以外)</caption>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:33.3%;\">BIG</th>\n                            <th style=\"width:33.3%;\">REG</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>4.7%</td>\n                            <td>95.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>4.7%</td>\n                            <td>95.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>5.5%</td>\n                            <td>94.5%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>5.9%</td>\n                            <td>94.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>6.3%</td>\n                            <td>93.7%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n\n\n            \n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination6\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/new-7.png\" alt=\"new\" class=\"update-icon\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                    ナビ無し3枚役出現率</h3>\n                    <div class=\"update-date\" data-date=\"2024-07-08\">2024/07/08更新</div>\n                <p>ボーナス中に出現するナビ無しの3枚役は、偶数設定であるほど、また高設定であるほど出やすい傾向のようです。</p>\n                <p>なお、設定5は極端に出現率が低いようです。</p>\n            </div>\n\n               \n            \n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">高設定狙いに必要な演出法則</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n           \n            <button class=\"close\">ー閉じる</button>\n        </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>","shukei":""}